yment capabilities. Here's what's been configured:\n\n### **Git Server**\n- **Repository**: `ssh://git@localhost:/git/project` (bare repository at `/git/project`)\n- **Authentication**: Password-based SSH (username: `git`, password: `password`)\n- **SSH Service**: Running on port 22\n\n### **Deployment System**\n- **Post-receive Hook**: Automatically triggers on every push\n- **Deployment Directories**:\n  - Main branch → `/var/www/main/`\n  - Dev branch → `/var/www/dev/`\n- **Deployment Speed**: ~300ms (well under the 3-second requirement)\n\n### **HTTPS Service** \n- **Nginx**: Running on port 8443 with self-signed certificate\n- **Main Branch Endpoint**: `https://localhost:8443/index.html` → serves `/var/www/main/index.html`\n- **Dev Branch Endpoint**: `https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html` → serves `/var/www/dev/index.html`\n- **Certificate**: Valid until 2027-09-04 at `/etc/nginx/certs/cert.pem`\n\n### **Verification Results** ✓\n- SSH password authentication working\n- Git clone, commit, and push operations successful\n- Post-receive hook deploys both branches correctly\n- HTTPS endpoints return correct branch-specific content\n- Deployment completes within 3 seconds (typically ~300ms)\n\nThe system is fully operational and ready to accept Git pushes that will automatically deploy content to the HTTPS endpoints.","ttft_ms":3475,"type":"result","duration_ms":193521,"uuid":"25062558-4304-45e1-aba5-5091d6195fc6","ttft_stream_ms":871,"time_to_request_ms":79,"queued_turn_count":0}
